/*
  ESP32-S3  |  USD / SYP monitor
  ---------------------------------------------------------------
  Source  : sp-today.com (الليرة اليوم) - US dollar page
  Display : 16x2 LCD (HD44780, 16-pin parallel) in 4-bit mode
  LEDs    : GREEN = dollar rising, RED = dollar falling
            (the last direction stays lit while the market is closed)
  Refresh : every 30 seconds
  Board   : "ESP32S3 Dev Module"     Library: LiquidCrystal (built-in)

  Wiring
    LCD  1 VSS -> GND         2 VDD -> 5V         3 V0 -> 10k pot (contrast)
         4 RS  -> GPIO4       5 RW  -> GND        6 E  -> GPIO5
         7-10 (D0-D3) -> not connected
         11 D4 -> GPIO6   12 D5 -> GPIO7   13 D6 -> GPIO15   14 D7 -> GPIO16
         15 A -> 5V (via 220R if the module has no resistor)   16 K -> GND
    Green LED -> GPIO17 -> 220R -> GND
    Red   LED -> GPIO18 -> 220R -> GND
*/

